@startuml
title Suggest Related Vocabulary Sequence (/api/words/{id})

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Learner
boundary "Suggest Related Vocabulary UI" as RelatedUi
control "WordDetailNotifier\n(FE Mobile)" as FeController
control "WordDetailApiService\n(FE Mobile)" as FeApiService
entity "WordDetailDto\n(FE Response DTO)" as FeWordDetailDto
entity "WordRelationDto\n(FE Response DTO)" as FeRelationDto
entity "WordDetailResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as BeWordDetailDto
control "WordsController\n(BE API)" as BeController
control "WordReadService" as WordService
control "IWordReadService" as IWordReadService
entity "Word" as WordEntity
entity "WordSense" as WordSenseEntity
entity "WordRelation" as WordRelationEntity
control "WordReadRepository" as WordRepository
control "IWordReadRepository" as IWordReadRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL

note over RelatedUi, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Mobile UI file exists: word_detail_screen.dart.
FE controller/service exist: WordDetailNotifier and WordDetailApiService.
FE DTOs exist: WordDetailDto and WordRelationDto.
BE controller exists: WordsController.
BE response DTO exists: WordDetailResponse.
There is no separate suggest-related endpoint in current code;
related vocabulary is returned inside GET /api/words/{id}.
Entities exist: Word, WordSense and WordRelation.
Interfaces used in code: IWordReadService, IWordReadRepository.
end note

Learner -> RelatedUi: Open related vocabulary area
RelatedUi -> FeController: load(wordId)
FeController -> FeApiService: getWord(wordId)
FeApiService -> BeController: GET /api/words/{id}
BeController -> IWordReadService: GetByIdAsync(id)
IWordReadService -> WordService: GetByIdAsync(id)
WordService -> IWordReadRepository: FindDetailAsync(id)
IWordReadRepository -> WordRepository: FindDetailAsync(id)
WordRepository -> DbContext: Query word detail with relations
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT words with senses\nand word_relations
MySQL --> DbContext: Word detail rows or null

alt Word not found
    DbContext --> WordRepository: null
    WordRepository --> WordService: null
    WordService --> BeController: NotFound result
    BeController --> FeApiService: HTTP 404 error
    FeApiService --> FeController: Action failed
    FeController --> RelatedUi: Show error
else Word found
    DbContext -> WordEntity: Read Word
    DbContext -> WordSenseEntity: Read WordSenses
    DbContext -> WordRelationEntity: Read WordRelations
    WordEntity --> DbContext: Word
    WordSenseEntity --> DbContext: Meanings
    WordRelationEntity --> DbContext: Related vocabulary
    DbContext --> WordRepository: Word detail graph
    WordRepository --> WordService: Word detail
    WordService --> BeController: Word detail result
    BeController -> BeWordDetailDto: Create WordDetailResponse
    BeWordDetailDto --> BeController: WordDetailResponse
    BeController --> FeApiService: HTTP 200 OK\nWordDetailResponse
    FeApiService -> FeWordDetailDto: Parse response data
    FeWordDetailDto -> FeRelationDto: Parse relations
    FeRelationDto --> FeWordDetailDto: WordRelation list
    FeWordDetailDto --> FeApiService: WordDetail
    FeApiService --> FeController: Word detail
    FeController --> RelatedUi: Show related vocabulary
end

@enduml
